"pcie0_dbi_dsp_reg_wr_rd_test","PCIE pcie0_dbi_dsp_reg_wr_rd_test register read/write validation","1) Build and run program.c in this folder. 2) Initialize PCIe link and DBI interface. 3) Perform register write/read-back sequence defined in program.c using test_define.c mappings (macros expanded to register names). 4) Validate that read values match written values and that error/status flags remain clear. 5) Record results.","All DBI DSP register write/read validations pass; no mismatches or error flags.","P2","S2","Planned","PCIE,DBI,DSP,reg,wr,rd","https://github.com/titusbspgit/PSVValidation/tree/main/TestRepo/pcie/pcie0_dbi_dsp_reg_wr_rd_test","TestRepo/pcie/pcie0_dbi_dsp_reg_wr_rd_test","PCIE"
